Package: parkeze-adopt
Version: @VERSION@-@BUILD@
Depends: ucode, ucode-mod-uci, curl, ca-bundle, openssl-util, qrencode, jsonfilter
Source: parkeze
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: One-touch provisioning and adoption.
 Mints a claim identity at first boot, shows it as a QR over SSH and in the
 console, and completes adoption on its own once somebody scans it. Receives
 the Tailscale auth key, MQTT credentials and the fleet recovery anchor.
